" begin="00:22.880" end="00:29.480"><span begin="00:22.880" end="00:23.900">And </span><span begin="00:23.900" end="00:23.930"> </span><span begin="00:23.930" end="00:25.340">you </span><span begin="00:25.340" end="00:25.940">spent </span><span begin="00:25.940" end="00:26.270">your </span><span begin="00:26.270" end="00:28.880">life</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:29.480" end="00:34.640"><span begin="00:29.480" end="00:30.440">Attached </span><span begin="00:30.440" end="00:30.590">to </span><span begin="00:30.590" end="00:31.160">this </span><span begin="00:31.160" end="00:33.860">poison</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:34.640" end="00:39.950"><span begin="00:34.640" end="00:35.180">You </span><span begin="00:35.180" end="00:35.540">don't </span><span begin="00:35.540" end="00:36.080">feel </span><span begin="00:36.080" end="00:37.190">anything </span><span begin="00:37.190" end="00:37.220"> </span><span begin="00:37.220" end="00:37.760">out </span><span begin="00:37.760" end="00:38.030">of </span><span begin="00:38.030" end="00:38.240">the </span><span begin="00:38.240" end="00:39.530">rain</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:39.950" end="00:43.130"><span begin="00:39.950" end="00:40.310">And </span><span begin="00:40.310" end="00:40.700">it's </span><span begin="00:40.700" end="00:41.990">true </span><span begin="00:41.990" end="00:43.070">that</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:43.130" end="00:48.830"><span begin="00:43.130" end="00:44.540">You </span><span begin="00:44.540" end="00:45.200">spend </span><span begin="00:45.200" end="00:45.500">your </span><span begin="00:45.500" end="00:47.900">life</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:48.830" end="00:51.380"><span begin="00:48.830" end="00:49.580">Trapped </span><span begin="00:49.580" end="00:49.730">in </span><span begin="00:49.730" end="00:50.240">this </span><span begin="00:50.240" end="00:51.380">void</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:51.380" end="00:58.070"><span begin="00:51.380" end